      "narration_text": "Here's the discipline: treat what comes back as leads, not verdicts. A finding that lines up with what you expected doesn't confirm it's true — the scout can be confidently wrong. And a finding that surprises you doesn't confirm it's false either — it might be exactly the gap you needed to see. Either way: verify the load-bearing claims, check the sources, and keep the judgment yours.",
